# IsoRim animals batch odyherd1 (blob style): Moose bull + cow, Muskox, Scimitar cat, Tiger, Mastodon. Generated by
# tools/make_odyherd1_concept.py (moose, muskox, scimitar cat from the v2 run, tiger from v3, mastodon = v3 variant B, its
# material and files named as the others; merged into this one file at integration, 2026-11-18, animals8).
# Kd = the sprite lit white (0.96); the textures hold the sprite colours relative to that white.
# All untinted in vanilla: colours baked (no tintFromGraphic).
newmtl an_moose_male_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/MooseMale

newmtl an_moose_female_blob
Kd 0.960 0.960 0.960
map_Kd IsoRim/Animals/MooseFemale

